{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["Field station generator FS-18 has serial number GEN-8831.","Generator FS-18 is stored on rack B-04 in the field station equipment shed.","The spare battery assigned to generator FS-18 is labeled BAT-22.","The field station inventory custodian for generator FS-18 is Imani Cole.","field station equipment inventory: the weather mast uses a separate calibration notebook.","field station equipment inventory: the satellite phone has an unrelated charging pouch.","field station equipment inventory: the sample freezer keeps a different temperature log.","field station equipment inventory: the trail camera kit is stored in an auxiliary cabinet.","field station equipment inventory: the first aid locker receives a monthly seal check.","field station equipment inventory: the water sampler has a separate replacement membrane.","field station equipment inventory: the solar controller displays an unrelated diagnostic code.","field station equipment inventory: the radio repeater uses another antenna bracket.","field station equipment inventory: the field kitchen counts a different fuel canister.","field station equipment inventory: the map case contains an unrelated survey grid.","field station equipment inventory: the microscope travels in a separate hard case.","field station equipment inventory: the snow sensor has an independent mounting note."],"truncate":false}